    RAISING   /rb4r/lo_cx_rest_frmwrk.

  METHODS generic_api_creation_steps
    IMPORTING is_api          TYPE /rb4r/lo_apis
    EXPORTING ev_alt_api      TYPE REF TO /rb4r/lo_cl_rest_api_request
              ev_content_type TYPE string
